   "shortComment": "The Bucs have elevated Stick from the practice squad ahead of Sunday's game against the Steelers.",
   "longComment": "With Baker Mayfield (thumb) missing another game, Stick will again handle QB2 duties behind starter Jalon Daniels. Stick hasn't attempted a regular-season pass since the 2023 season while with the Chargers.",
